{"data":{"body":"[P2] The new public offloader is tested only through direct method calls. That does not exercise `DurableConfig`, `PayloadCodec`, executor routing, checkpoint persistence, or replay, and project rules require integration coverage for public API changes. Add a `LocalDurableTestRunner` test that configures this offloader and verifies checkpoint/suspend/replay loading, including an `OVERFLOW` payload and retryable storage failure.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7pplT_","finding_digest":"6ae3d3518ee5b48b73b468550a542a23c0ce638d03e48daa57265a57a754be18","finding_id":"arf_v1_nlr5gumo4w2iw45unbkquvbkep","finding_key":"sdk/offload/filesystem/filesystempayloadoffloadertest::public-api::integration-replay-coverage","identity_key":"sdk/offload/filesystem/filesystempayloadoffloadertest::public-api::integration-replay-coverage","line":27,"observation_digest":"e396e49b5a67a33ebd5c95c3330f441ab57eaab7d661cbeff5db6f3f860e48bd","observation_id":"aro_v1_4olojg22m6rt5pk4sxbtgd2edk","path":"sdk/src/test/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/offload/filesystem/FileSystemPayloadOffloaderTest.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-03T00:41:58Z","review_id":"arr_v1_fxd2azzpefqbkxdrbguqhvpfz4","reviewed_base_sha":"a52a63745d2f0ef2031adef2aeb872568f0fafbf","reviewed_head_sha":"578208f0b55d4110cb89acd77a1e5923488e80d6","reviewer":"codex","start_line":27,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":681},"record_id":"art_v1_rnp23gs7ddxksqltbbmlqokvo5","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-03T00:41:58Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
